  <p id="c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040:p001:m0000" ref="2r8_97h_fad_A">路溫舒</persName>字<persName id="c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040:p001:m0004" ref="2r8_97h_fad_A">長君</persName>，鉅鹿東里人也。父爲里監門。</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-051-luwenshu-qi040:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">臣聞秦有十失，其一尚存，治獄之吏是也。</p>
